                                                "sense_id": "67371295-957d-3372-9cc6-645aa7d79276",
                                                "text": "Mr. Free also owned restaurants and bred horses. His bay gelding, Packett's Landing, won almost $800,000 in his five-year career in the late 1980's and early 1990's."
